# To enable direct online message delivery to your email (jaseermohamed86@gmail.com):
#
# Option 1: Formspree (Recommended for static websites)
# 1. Sign up for free at https://formspree.io
# 2. Click "New Form", name it "QS Portfolio", and enter jaseermohamed86@gmail.com
# 3. Copy your Form ID (e.g., https://formspree.io/f/mqkvnxyz)
# 4. Uncomment the line below and paste your endpoint:
# VITE_FORMSPREE_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/YOUR_FORM_ID

# Option 2: Web3Forms (Alternative)
# 1. Visit https://web3forms.com/#start
# 2. Enter your email (jaseermohamed86@gmail.com) to receive an Access Key
# 3. Uncomment the line below and paste your access key:
# VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=your_access_key_here
